{"id": "x00334", "text": "- **Head Commit:** `656b260c3` (`[VIT-295] Add duration-aware sharding and 12 sequence config fields`)"}
{"id": "x00335", "text": "- If implicated (e.g. referenced in sibling selector, `:empty`, nth-child), do not remove it!"}
{"id": "x00336", "text": "2. **Push conflict risk**: origin already has `feature/drift-detection-baselines` at 34fad333 (WIP notes-only commit on top of main). Local branch diverged from main without that commit, so a plain push will be non-fast-forward. Need to decide: merge/cherry-pick 34fad333 (preserving notes/drift-detection.md) or force-with-lease. Origin is `/srv/git/arcane.git`."}
