{"id": "x00341", "text": "- Quoting window names is handled via `sql.identifier(w.name)` which automatically applies the dialect's identifier quotation (`\"` for Postgres/SQLite/Gel, `\\`` for MySQL/SingleStore)."}
{"id": "x00342", "text": "The visible user message is a meta-instruction: the previous response hit the output token limit (`finish_reason=length`) before producing a tool call, so respond more concisely and end with exactly one bash tool call. The ongoing task (established before this window): fix the known correctness failures in the oxvg repo — per the correctness README, \"nested selector lost by `collapse_groups`\" and \"sibling selector lost by `remove_empty_containers`\" — by making structural-rewrite optimiser jobs respect structure-sensitive CSS selectors (combinators, positional pseudo-classes) on a WIP branch."}
