{"id": "x00352", "text": "- `PartialResult` class with public attrs `value`, `is_complete`, `structured_fields` (frozenset), `failed_fields` (frozenset), `errors`, `error_map` (dict field→exception) and private `_converter`, `_cl`, `_input`, `_keys`, `_partials`. `__slots__`; `frozenset()`/`None` defaults (avoided function-call defaults for lint B008); custom `__repr__`."}
